# The desk's icons, in their order (Apps says the form); on the card,
# /lib/desktop/desk; a person's own in $home/lib/desktop/desk.
top | Terminal     | term   | 640x400 | rc -i
top | Files        | folder | 640x480 | files /usr/pad
top | Programs     | folder | 640x480 | files /progs
top | Office       | doc    | 800x600 | office
top | Netscape     | globe  | 900x700 | netscape
top | Emacs        | editor | 720x560 | emacs
top | Tetris       | blocks | 400x600 | tetris
top | Doom         | face   | max     | doom
